{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1607.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"2e2588dda9922009e29e3377fef29495649443b30cd1c772783f6f02ad51fe10","ja":"地雷系女子のお勉強","zh":"学习地雷系女生","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1607.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"3e3171a047534962c1d9eae63d7a3f656d76a1cd04697bdcec96f033a61e0a3f","ja":"どうでしょう～？\n参考になりましたか～？","zh":"感觉如何～？\n有帮上您的忙吗～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1607.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"62ea9cf4b79defa99c298ca20b7394341140f4c47d71ddc00edaa93f03451363","ja":"ああ。同じ地雷系でも、\nいろんな違いがあるんだな。","zh":"啊。虽说同为地雷系，\n原来也有各种各样的差异啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1607.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"cced89c7b1b0dbda08f2d7a95f02e58243b6c257a27562c41dc13794878e1104","ja":"ミャオが役作りした時も、\nこうやって、参考にしたのか？","zh":"喵塑造角色的时候，\n也是像这样作参考的吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1607.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"e392caf6f558ae9def2fb26e10ec50db6b2a35b95ea151dece9c9bd99deea3cb","ja":"そうですね～。あとは、\n流行をチェックしたりでしょうか～。","zh":"也是呢～之后就是，\n看看流行趋势之类的吧～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1607.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"bdad644b314cc22738c19f13eda6ae460b137afd41b98201ddd951c3ef23c0cd","ja":"たとえば、地雷系ドリンクといえば……これ、\nストローをさしたエナジードリンクです～。","zh":"比如说到地雷系饮品的话……就是这个，\n插着吸管的能量饮料～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1607.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"0c9694a5f6565e8a042466aa5b8cee2a8345e22ea34d545186a636ee76ba3151","ja":"なんでエナドリにストローを……？\n……ああ、口紅がとれないようにか。","zh":"为什么在能量饮料里插吸管……？\n……啊，是为了防止口红掉色啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1607.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"48a94b5e93c8b8248a5066fbfa13dce33e4f95e4214e5cd171f9371db4314d76","ja":"たぶん、そうではないかと～。\nそれでは、そろそろ次の場所に行きましょう～。","zh":"大概就是这样吧～\n那么，差不多该去下一个地方了～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1607.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"c1e996f2bed03a71286f10ab3b61bcf1b1d45a2d25a433d881b30feb4e276808","ja":"ここは、地雷系御用達のショップです～。\n小物とかアクセサリーもありますよ～。","zh":"这里是地雷系专宠的店铺哦～。\n也有小物件和饰品之类的哦～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1607.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"f57a0d94198a0656d2a64bcf4d920e0b7829efea7079f10cc31280a8a2d270b3","ja":"黒とピンク系が多いんだな。フリルにレースに\nくまやウサギ……可愛い系って感じか……。","zh":"黑色和粉色系的挺多啊。荷叶边配蕾丝，\n小熊加兔子……感觉走的是可爱风啊……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1607.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"54bb42a3a66842e6d5681b0bac11740e1e2502aa8c86cb29e3d2fcf257521afd","ja":"あ、でもこのチョーカーとかシルバーのデザインは、\nヴィジュアル系とかバンギャっぽいかもな。","zh":"啊，不过这条项圈和银饰的设计，\n可能还挺有视觉系或者邦ギャ风格的呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1607.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"8682edc72aa663e255f1e9839e47a5e4d9fb86cfa2b03a99a7c5812910def4c3","ja":"他のアイテムと組み合わせると、\n急に地雷系っぽくなりますね～。面白いですな～♪","zh":"和其他道具搭配起来，\n突然就很有地雷系的感觉呢～。真有趣啊～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1607.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"21ce9b04a9e70f1556c2e52e8cb94fcee197d50ebf68ab77cc5172286e32e4e5","ja":"ですが……前に来た時から少し時間が経っているので、\n合ってるかどうか、ちょっと心配ですね～。","zh":"不过……因为距离上次来已经过了一段时间，\n到底对不对，让人稍微有点担心呢～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1607.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"768e591a2547d7e7a15cf8d0166a4c4bd7a219a96dab74d368b26d3cae18fc30","ja":"流行って、すぐに変わっちまうからな。","zh":"流行这东西，变得可真快啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1607.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"1419cee4b0c0e2483c5933f19473df0fadc64ac12446d3a9820e409580909470","ja":"はい～。なのでちょっと、現地の方に\nリサーチしてみましょう～。すみません～。","zh":"好的～。所以我们稍微向当地人\n打听一下吧～。不好意思～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1607.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"4efc4d7724f9f6be7ca305ddf83acb381554b87fb4a2c277131dc521d5a62a63","ja":"ええっ！？\nちょ、ちょっと、ミャオ！？","zh":"诶诶！？\n等、等等，喵儿！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
